# 6. Merchant verification levels

Do not use a single binary verified/unverified flag.

## Level 0 — Directory listed

Requirements:

- imported or submitted profile;
- source provenance;
- no owner claim.

Capabilities:

- public discovery page;
- report correction;
- no Alo King orders;
- no merchant editing.

## Level 1 — Contact verified

Requirements:

- OTP or verified reply from a public business number;
- no unresolved ownership conflict.

Capabilities:

- edit public business facts;
- add logo/photos;
- set hours and service area;
- start menu onboarding.

## Level 2 — Merchant verified

Requirements:

- ownership/manager evidence;
- business identity review;
- approved merchant agreement;
- operational contact;
- payout/payment details if applicable.

Capabilities:

- accept Alo King orders;
- publish verified menu;
- receive order alerts;
- manage availability;
- issue approved substitutions.

## Level 3 — Campaign-enabled

Requirements:

- completed profile and menu;
- order fulfilment history;
- active consent-safe campaign account;
- payment/recharge method verified;
- campaign terms accepted;
- quality threshold met.

Capabilities:

- paid broadcasts;
- audience targeting;
- personalized recommendations;
- analytics;
- campaign credits.

## Level 4 — Trusted merchant

Requirements:

- consistent fulfilment;
- low complaint/rejection rate;
- accurate menu and hours;
- reliable order acceptance;
- quality score sustained over time.

Capabilities:

- higher campaign limits;
- faster approvals;
- advanced promotions;
- lower operational restrictions where justified.

