# 7. If a business is not in Alo King

## 7.1 Customer or merchant add flow

Allow anyone to submit a missing business:

```text
Business name
Category
Village/area
Public phone
Map location
Website/social link, optional
Submitter relationship
```

Do not immediately publish it as a verified partner.

## 7.2 Duplicate search before creating

Search existing records by:

- exact and fuzzy name;
- Arabic/Latin transliteration;
- phone;
- map proximity;
- address;
- website/social domain;
- category.

If a likely match exists:

> We found a possible existing page for this business. Would you like to claim it instead?

## 7.3 New business state

```text
submitted
possible_duplicate
needs_contact_check
contact_verified
pending_merchant_review
verified_unpublished
live_directory
live_ordering
rejected
```

## 7.4 New business verification

Minimum requirements before live ordering:

- verified operator contact;
- business name and location confirmed;
- operating hours;
- delivery/service area;
- menu with prices;
- order alert channel;
- merchant agreement;
- fulfilment and cancellation policy;
- payment/reconciliation setup;
- owner or manager role verified.

## 7.5 Self-added business from a personal phone

A personal phone can start a submission, but it should receive only:

- pending status;
- a request for proof;
- a link to complete verification.

Do not grant menu editing, order acceptance, or broadcasts until ownership is verified.

