# 9. Merchant portal and merchant WhatsApp parity

The portal and merchant WhatsApp should use the same backend capabilities.

## Portal is best for

- bulk menu editing;
- photos;
- opening-hours calendar;
- analytics;
- campaign audience review;
- team permissions;
- invoices and statements;
- dispute history.

## WhatsApp is best for

- urgent out-of-stock updates;
- opening/closing temporarily;
- accepting orders;
- quick price correction;
- checking balance;
- pausing campaigns;
- receiving alerts;
- simple offers.

Do not implement separate business rules in the portal and WhatsApp bot. Use shared service functions and permission checks.

